{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-05-07-why-most-distressed-deals-in-dubai-are-fake-05sbejv5zho-md-5ae767c007:u000010", "youtube-video-2026-05-07-why-most-distressed-deals-in-dubai-are-fake-05sbejv5zho-md-5ae767c007:u000011"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "claim", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "Headlines about the Dubai property index, thirty percent down, do not automatically mean that the actual property prices fell by the same percentage.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-05-07-why-most-distressed-deals-in-dubai-are-fake-05sbejv5zho-md-5ae767c007:u000010"}], "text": "Headlines about the Dubai property index showing a 30% decline do not automatically mean that property prices have fallen by the same percentage."}, "title": "Dubai real estate assessment", "topic": "Dubai real estate"}, "content_hash": "a4988032b692c8e807691ae15de3be8bd65734794879b4c3650c747f0b818902", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-05-07-why-most-distressed-deals-in-dubai-are-fake-05sbejv5zho-md-5ae767c007:knowledge:6150617772c018b7", "metadata_hash": "477e3f9183387fd8f5751a5f6a151f4c49e6181533878b5c3fa419e807b0bbad", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-05-07", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "75f0a1a8e0bc718c8f2fb968213468bec85dfb92a21d94fd2f59c7e309942cbe", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-05-07-why-most-distressed-deals-in-dubai-are-fake-05sbejv5zho-md-5ae767c007", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=05sBEJV5Zho", "title": "Dubai real estate assessment", "topic": "Dubai real estate", "topic_slug": "dubai-real-estate"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-05-07-why-most-distressed-deals-in-dubai-are-fake-05sbejv5zho-md-5ae767c007:u000002"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "offering", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "By the end of this video, you will have a clear step-by-step strategy for finding a real distress opportunities, not just discounted listing. A practical method to structure the offers that can get you forty below the previous market price, not just like ten percent off.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-05-07-why-most-distressed-deals-in-dubai-are-fake-05sbejv5zho-md-5ae767c007:u000002"}], "text": "By the end of the video, viewers will have a step-by-step strategy for finding real distressed opportunities in Dubai real estate, aiming for 40% below previous market price."}, "title": "Distressed deal strategy", "topic": "Dubai real estate"}, "content_hash": "a4988032b692c8e807691ae15de3be8bd65734794879b4c3650c747f0b818902", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-05-07-why-most-distressed-deals-in-dubai-are-fake-05sbejv5zho-md-5ae767c007:knowledge:631b8532220a9332", "metadata_hash": "477e3f9183387fd8f5751a5f6a151f4c49e6181533878b5c3fa419e807b0bbad", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-05-07", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "75f0a1a8e0bc718c8f2fb968213468bec85dfb92a21d94fd2f59c7e309942cbe", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-05-07-why-most-distressed-deals-in-dubai-are-fake-05sbejv5zho-md-5ae767c007", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=05sBEJV5Zho", "title": "Distressed deal strategy", "topic": "Dubai real estate", "topic_slug": "dubai-real-estate"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-05-07-why-most-distressed-deals-in-dubai-are-fake-05sbejv5zho-md-5ae767c007:u000004", "youtube-video-2026-05-07-why-most-distressed-deals-in-dubai-are-fake-05sbejv5zho-md-5ae767c007:u000005", "youtube-video-2026-05-07-why-most-distressed-deals-in-dubai-are-fake-05sbejv5zho-md-5ae767c007:u000006", "youtube-video-2026-05-07-why-most-distressed-deals-in-dubai-are-fake-05sbejv5zho-md-5ae767c007:u000007", "youtube-video-2026-05-07-why-most-distressed-deals-in-dubai-are-fake-05sbejv5zho-md-5ae767c007:u000008"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "claim", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "Developer deals, the off-plan projects, and secondary market distress properties owned by individuals. They do not behave the same way.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-05-07-why-most-distressed-deals-in-dubai-are-fake-05sbejv5zho-md-5ae767c007:u000004"}, {"quote": "He cannot suddenly drop to four hundred on the same conditions. Why? Because that would destroy investor trust, damage his reputation, and... make buyers ignore his next project... So, what does he do instead? He keeps the headline prices close to the old levels but changes the condition he gives.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-05-07-why-most-distressed-deals-in-dubai-are-fake-05sbejv5zho-md-5ae767c007:u000005"}, {"quote": "He keeps the headline prices close to the old levels but changes the condition he gives. Better deals for cash buyers, offer longer pay payment plans, more flexible payment plans...", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-05-07-why-most-distressed-deals-in-dubai-are-fake-05sbejv5zho-md-5ae767c007:u000006"}, {"quote": "secondary market properties are ready units owned by individuals.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-05-07-why-most-distressed-deals-in-dubai-are-fake-05sbejv5zho-md-5ae767c007:u000007"}, {"quote": "Here, the price is not controlled by the developer. It's controlled by one person situation.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-05-07-why-most-distressed-deals-in-dubai-are-fake-05sbejv5zho-md-5ae767c007:u000008"}], "text": "There is a difference between developer deals and secondary market properties. Developers may modify conditions rather than lowering prices, while secondary market properties depend on individual situations."}, "title": "Developer and secondary market differences", "topic": "Dubai real estate"}, "content_hash": "a4988032b692c8e807691ae15de3be8bd65734794879b4c3650c747f0b818902", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-05-07-why-most-distressed-deals-in-dubai-are-fake-05sbejv5zho-md-5ae767c007:knowledge:651628f8066b4434", "metadata_hash": "477e3f9183387fd8f5751a5f6a151f4c49e6181533878b5c3fa419e807b0bbad", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-05-07", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "75f0a1a8e0bc718c8f2fb968213468bec85dfb92a21d94fd2f59c7e309942cbe", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-05-07-why-most-distressed-deals-in-dubai-are-fake-05sbejv5zho-md-5ae767c007", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=05sBEJV5Zho", "title": "Developer and secondary market differences", "topic": "Dubai real estate", "topic_slug": "dubai-real-estate"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-05-07-why-most-distressed-deals-in-dubai-are-fake-05sbejv5zho-md-5ae767c007:u000017", "youtube-video-2026-05-07-why-most-distressed-deals-in-dubai-are-fake-05sbejv5zho-md-5ae767c007:u000018"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "advice", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "Now we are moving to negotiation strategy, not just psychology. If you are emotionally attached to one property, you will overpay. If you can walk away, you become a dangerous negotiation.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-05-07-why-most-distressed-deals-in-dubai-are-fake-05sbejv5zho-md-5ae767c007:u000017"}, {"quote": "First, put yourself in the seller's shoes.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-05-07-why-most-distressed-deals-in-dubai-are-fake-05sbejv5zho-md-5ae767c007:u000018"}], "text": "When negotiating for a distressed property, avoid emotional attachment, understand the seller's perspective, and be ready to move quickly on opportunities."}, "title": "Negotiation strategy", "topic": "Real estate negotiation"}, "content_hash": "a4988032b692c8e807691ae15de3be8bd65734794879b4c3650c747f0b818902", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-05-07-why-most-distressed-deals-in-dubai-are-fake-05sbejv5zho-md-5ae767c007:knowledge:9b9078cc72bfa007", "metadata_hash": "477e3f9183387fd8f5751a5f6a151f4c49e6181533878b5c3fa419e807b0bbad", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-05-07", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "75f0a1a8e0bc718c8f2fb968213468bec85dfb92a21d94fd2f59c7e309942cbe", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-05-07-why-most-distressed-deals-in-dubai-are-fake-05sbejv5zho-md-5ae767c007", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=05sBEJV5Zho", "title": "Negotiation strategy", "topic": "Real estate negotiation", "topic_slug": "real-estate-negotiation"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-05-07-why-most-distressed-deals-in-dubai-are-fake-05sbejv5zho-md-5ae767c007:u000024"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "advice", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "Preparation means knowing what to buy, where to buy it, how to check, and how to negotiate with the right seller.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-05-07-why-most-distressed-deals-in-dubai-are-fake-05sbejv5zho-md-5ae767c007:u000024"}], "text": "Preparation to buy in Dubai's real estate market involves knowing what to buy, where to buy it, and how to negotiate with sellers effectively."}, "title": "Preparation for buying in Dubai", "topic": "Real estate preparation"}, "content_hash": "a4988032b692c8e807691ae15de3be8bd65734794879b4c3650c747f0b818902", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-05-07-why-most-distressed-deals-in-dubai-are-fake-05sbejv5zho-md-5ae767c007:knowledge:885b41595ef8fc71", "metadata_hash": "477e3f9183387fd8f5751a5f6a151f4c49e6181533878b5c3fa419e807b0bbad", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-05-07", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "75f0a1a8e0bc718c8f2fb968213468bec85dfb92a21d94fd2f59c7e309942cbe", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-05-07-why-most-distressed-deals-in-dubai-are-fake-05sbejv5zho-md-5ae767c007", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=05sBEJV5Zho", "title": "Preparation for buying in Dubai", "topic": "Real estate preparation", "topic_slug": "real-estate-preparation"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-05-07-why-most-distressed-deals-in-dubai-are-fake-05sbejv5zho-md-5ae767c007:u000023"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "advice", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "I have a bad news for you. Real distress deals like this can be gone within two or three hours. So let me ask you, are you ready to move that fast? Most people are not.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-05-07-why-most-distressed-deals-in-dubai-are-fake-05sbejv5zho-md-5ae767c007:u000023"}], "text": "Buyers need to prepare to move quickly on real distressed deals, which can be resolved within two to three hours."}, "title": "Importance of market preparation", "topic": "Dubai real estate"}, "content_hash": "a4988032b692c8e807691ae15de3be8bd65734794879b4c3650c747f0b818902", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-05-07-why-most-distressed-deals-in-dubai-are-fake-05sbejv5zho-md-5ae767c007:knowledge:156f21ad382891ac", "metadata_hash": "477e3f9183387fd8f5751a5f6a151f4c49e6181533878b5c3fa419e807b0bbad", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-05-07", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "75f0a1a8e0bc718c8f2fb968213468bec85dfb92a21d94fd2f59c7e309942cbe", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-05-07-why-most-distressed-deals-in-dubai-are-fake-05sbejv5zho-md-5ae767c007", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=05sBEJV5Zho", "title": "Importance of market preparation", "topic": "Dubai real estate", "topic_slug": "dubai-real-estate"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-05-07-why-most-distressed-deals-in-dubai-are-fake-05sbejv5zho-md-5ae767c007:u000004", "youtube-video-2026-05-07-why-most-distressed-deals-in-dubai-are-fake-05sbejv5zho-md-5ae767c007:u000005", "youtube-video-2026-05-07-why-most-distressed-deals-in-dubai-are-fake-05sbejv5zho-md-5ae767c007:u000006"], "form": "structure", "observation": {"citations": [{"quote": "two different markets. Developer deals, the off-plan projects, and secondary market distress properties owned by individuals. They do not behave the same way.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-05-07-why-most-distressed-deals-in-dubai-are-fake-05sbejv5zho-md-5ae767c007:u000004"}, {"quote": "He cannot suddenly drop to four hundred on the same conditions. Why? Because that would destroy investor trust, damage his reputation, and make buyers ignore his next project.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-05-07-why-most-distressed-deals-in-dubai-are-fake-05sbejv5zho-md-5ae767c007:u000005"}, {"quote": "He keeps the headline prices close to the old levels but changes the condition he gives. Better deals for cash buyers, offer longer payment plans, more flexible payment plans.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-05-07-why-most-distressed-deals-in-dubai-are-fake-05sbejv5zho-md-5ae767c007:u000006"}], "text": "The speaker contrasts developer deals (specifically mentioning off-plan projects) with secondary market distressed properties, explaining how they operate differently to establish a basis for understanding Dubai's real estate dynamics."}, "purpose": {"citations": [{"quote": "two different markets. Developer deals, the off-plan projects, and secondary market distress properties owned by individuals. They do not behave the same way.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-05-07-why-most-distressed-deals-in-dubai-are-fake-05sbejv5zho-md-5ae767c007:u000004"}], "text": "To clarify the differences in behavior between two types of real estate markets: developer deals and secondary market properties."}, "speaker_id": "1", "title": "Analytical comparison of market segments", "topic": "Dubai real estate"}, "content_hash": "a4988032b692c8e807691ae15de3be8bd65734794879b4c3650c747f0b818902", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-05-07-why-most-distressed-deals-in-dubai-are-fake-05sbejv5zho-md-5ae767c007:expression:cc029fb543b375c3", "metadata_hash": "477e3f9183387fd8f5751a5f6a151f4c49e6181533878b5c3fa419e807b0bbad", "product": "expression", "published_at": "2026-05-07", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "75f0a1a8e0bc718c8f2fb968213468bec85dfb92a21d94fd2f59c7e309942cbe", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-05-07-why-most-distressed-deals-in-dubai-are-fake-05sbejv5zho-md-5ae767c007", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=05sBEJV5Zho", "title": "Analytical comparison of market segments", "topic": "Dubai real estate", "topic_slug": "dubai-real-estate"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-05-07-why-most-distressed-deals-in-dubai-are-fake-05sbejv5zho-md-5ae767c007:u000028", "youtube-video-2026-05-07-why-most-distressed-deals-in-dubai-are-fake-05sbejv5zho-md-5ae767c007:u000029", "youtube-video-2026-05-07-why-most-distressed-deals-in-dubai-are-fake-05sbejv5zho-md-5ae767c007:u000030", "youtube-video-2026-05-07-why-most-distressed-deals-in-dubai-are-fake-05sbejv5zho-md-5ae767c007:u000031", "youtube-video-2026-05-07-why-most-distressed-deals-in-dubai-are-fake-05sbejv5zho-md-5ae767c007:u000032", "youtube-video-2026-05-07-why-most-distressed-deals-in-dubai-are-fake-05sbejv5zho-md-5ae767c007:u000033", "youtube-video-2026-05-07-why-most-distressed-deals-in-dubai-are-fake-05sbejv5zho-md-5ae767c007:u000034", "youtube-video-2026-05-07-why-most-distressed-deals-in-dubai-are-fake-05sbejv5zho-md-5ae767c007:u000035"], "exceptions": [], "goal": {"citations": [{"quote": "if you're hoping for thirty or even forty percent discount for a really good property, you cannot behave like a casual buyer. You are a distress deal hunter.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-05-07-why-most-distressed-deals-in-dubai-are-fake-05sbejv5zho-md-5ae767c007:u000034"}], "text": "To obtain a significant discount on good properties by taking advantage of distressed deals in Dubai."}, "kind": "method", "prerequisites": [{"citations": [{"quote": "Do your search, use property finder over you to both have an easy system to track and compare past sales and rental transactions.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-05-07-why-most-distressed-deals-in-dubai-are-fake-05sbejv5zho-md-5ae767c007:u000028"}], "text": "Understand the real estate market by doing proper research using property tracking systems to compare past sales and rental transactions."}], "steps": [{"citations": [{"quote": "based on unit type, square footage, developer, layout, budget. Do your search, use property finder over you to both have an easy system to track and compare past sales and rental transactions.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-05-07-why-most-distressed-deals-in-dubai-are-fake-05sbejv5zho-md-5ae767c007:u000028"}], "text": "Shortlist your project based on unit type, square footage, developer, layout, and budget."}, {"citations": [{"quote": "Before you fall in love with a discount, check the building reality. You need to understand tenants, complainants, owners, comments, maintenance issue, maybe it has an AC problem, noise, or traffic.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-05-07-why-most-distressed-deals-in-dubai-are-fake-05sbejv5zho-md-5ae767c007:u000029"}], "text": "Check the building reality and potential issues by reading tenants' and owners' reviews, not just brochures."}, {"citations": [{"quote": "If you want to buy a distress deal, you must act differently. Not with the WhatsApp, but with the real check made payable to the owner.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-05-07-why-most-distressed-deals-in-dubai-are-fake-05sbejv5zho-md-5ae767c007:u000031"}], "text": "Avoid using common negotiation methods like WhatsApp offers; instead, use a real check made payable to the owner."}, {"citations": [{"quote": "the best opportunities will not go to people who start searching at the last moment. They will go to buyers who prepare early, shortlisted the options, checked their buildings, and understood the real market value.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-05-07-why-most-distressed-deals-in-dubai-are-fake-05sbejv5zho-md-5ae767c007:u000032"}], "text": "Prepare early by shortlisting options, checking building conditions, and understanding the real market value."}, {"citations": [{"quote": "Start negotiating multiple units, stay emotionally detached and move fast when the right deal comes.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-05-07-why-most-distressed-deals-in-dubai-are-fake-05sbejv5zho-md-5ae767c007:u000033"}], "text": "Negotiate on multiple units simultaneously, stay emotionally detached, and act quickly when a suitable deal arises."}], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "if you're hoping for thirty or even forty percent discount for a really good property, you cannot behave like a casual buyer. You are a distress deal hunter. Your weapon is preparation, your advantage is emotional control.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-05-07-why-most-distressed-deals-in-dubai-are-fake-05sbejv5zho-md-5ae767c007:u000034"}], "text": "To successfully buy 'distressed deals' in Dubai, one should not act like a casual buyer but like a 'distress deal hunter,' focusing on preparation and emotional control."}, "title": "Property Buying Strategy", "topic": "real_estate"}, "content_hash": "a4988032b692c8e807691ae15de3be8bd65734794879b4c3650c747f0b818902", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-05-07-why-most-distressed-deals-in-dubai-are-fake-05sbejv5zho-md-5ae767c007:knowledge:3be79c39c0272b4c", "metadata_hash": "477e3f9183387fd8f5751a5f6a151f4c49e6181533878b5c3fa419e807b0bbad", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-05-07", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "75f0a1a8e0bc718c8f2fb968213468bec85dfb92a21d94fd2f59c7e309942cbe", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-05-07-why-most-distressed-deals-in-dubai-are-fake-05sbejv5zho-md-5ae767c007", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=05sBEJV5Zho", "title": "Property Buying Strategy", "topic": "real_estate", "topic_slug": "real_estate"}
